      {
        "id": "nd_0D0KQM7ZHG2Q3HWD9VJ2XSQ09W",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 40
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.6,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'retired stunt driver, 1920s, rendered as airbrush'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the full profile: strict 90-degree side view, silhouette-readable.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even blue-hour ambient with a single warm practical for separation, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 matte acrylic, hand-thrown ceramic and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to warm amber highlights rolling into cool slate shadows.\n\nOUTPUT. Emit one prompt, one paragraph, no framing text of any kind before or after it.",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "reference_images": 1
          }
        },
