          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.77,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'retired stunt driver, 1920s, rendered as airbrush'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the three-quarter left: 45 degrees to camera-left, weight on the back foot.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even a projected gobo throwing a broken pattern across the background, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 book-matched marble, crushed velvet and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to a neutral commercial grade with clean whites and no colour cast.\n\nOUTPUT. Your entire reply is the prompt itself: one dense paragraph, no title, no quotation marks, no trailing notes.",
